        "text": "Barbara Nessim: <i>An Artful Life</i> (V&A, 2013; Bard Graduate Center Gallery, 2014-15)\n\n<i><b>Dionne Warwick</b></i>\n1969\r\n\r\nThis poster advertised a concert by the American singer Dionne Warwick at New York’s Lincoln Center in 1969. Nessim chose to print the image using the ‘split fountain’ process, in which two or more colours are applied simultaneously. As a result, the colours blend into each other.\n\nPoster\nMuseum no. E.25-2013"
      }
    ],
